   "answer": "About guide\n:carousel_horse:1f3a0🎠#DEEBFFThis guide is only for Hööks.\nHow to onboard and use Windows Hello for an easy and secure way of signing into Windows.\nTable of contents\nChoose an option and select Set up\nFollow the instructions to complete the configuration of Windows Hello\nSign-in experience\nThe next time you sign in to your device, you can use facial recognition, fingerprint identification, or PIN code instead of your password.\nThis guide was copied from https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/configure-windows-hello-dae28983-8242-bb2a-d3d1-87c9d265a5f0\n",
   "source": "Confluence ITSM",
